ength        | 195 cm                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      | Same                                                                  |  |  |\n| Material                      |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |                                                                       |  |  |\n| Main Coil Wire                | Platinum/Tungsten Alloy (Pt/W: 92/8)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | Same                                                                  |  |  |\n| Coil-to-Pusher Coupler        | Platinum/Iridium (Pt/Ir: 90/10)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | Same                                                                  |  |  |\n| Adhesive                      | Ultraviolet Curing Adhesive                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | Same                                                                  |  |  |\n| Implant to Pusher<br>Filament | Polyolefin Elastomer                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | Same                                                                  |  |  |\n| Stretch resistant (SR)        | Polyethylene Terephthalate (K131948)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | Polyethylene<br>Terephthalate or<br>Polyolefin Elastomer<br>(Engage™) |  |  |\n\n| Other Attributes       |                                                                                                     |      |  |\n|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------|--|\n| Detachment System      | Detachment Controller; stand alone, hand<br>held battery operated unit detaches the coil<br>implant | Same |  |\n| Catheter compatibility | Compatible with 10-system microcatheters<br>(minimum ID of 0.0165\")                                 | Same |  |\n| MRI compatibility      | Yes                                                                                                 | Same |  |\n| Method of Supply       | Sterile and single use (e-beam)                                                                     | Same |  |\n| Package Configuration  | Placed in Introducer Sheath, Dispenser Coil,<br>Pouch, and Shipping Carton                          | Same |  |",
